/vendor/

# seg_probe writes `<stem>.mask.jpg` and `<stem>.overlay.jpg` beside itself in
# the working directory (see src/bin/seg_probe.rs). They are photo-derived
# debug output, so they must never be committed.
*.mask.jpg
*.overlay.jpg
